Right address.

17:28.252 --> 17:31.085
Oh, Charlie, you came to say goodbye.

17:32.390 --> 17:33.948
Unbelievable.

17:34.125 --> 17:36.389
You're gonna play this
all the way out to the end.

17:36.794 --> 17:41.629
- Play what out?
- All right, fine. We'll do it your way.

17:41.866 --> 17:44.892
Rose, you're a terrific woman.

17:45.369 --> 17:50.068
I'm an idiot for not seeing it
and I really don't want you to leave.

17:50.875 --> 17:54.367
- Really?
- Yeah. Here, look.

17:58.583 --> 17:59.607
Wow.

17:59.784 --> 18:02.014
- See?
- Oh, yeah.

18:04.222 --> 18:05.621
Well, that's my cab.

18:05.790 --> 18:07.087
- Goodbye.
- Wait, wait.

18:07.258 --> 18:10.091
- Wait, what the hell are you doing?
- I'm leaving.

18:10.261 --> 18:12.889
Don't you understand?
You can drop the act.

18:13.664 --> 18:16.292
I give up. I surrender.

18:16.467 --> 18:19.129
You win, Rose. I'm yours.

18:19.737 --> 18:22.638
Oh, Charlie, that's so sweet.

18:22.807 --> 18:25.640
But I know you.
You're just having a little panic attack...

18:25.810 --> 18:28.472
...because you're getting old
and nobody loves you.

18:28.646 --> 18:30.204
See, you get me.

18:30.615 --> 18:33.584
I do, which is why I have to leave.

18:38.156 --> 18:39.384
Goodbye, Charlie.

18:41.058 --> 18:42.525
Oh.

18:43.394 --> 18:45.487
I almost forgot.

18:46.030 --> 18:47.554
I thought you should have this.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.627
It's our first restraining order.

18:53.404 --> 18:55.099
Look how shaky your signature was.

18:57.241 --> 18:59.402
You were so spooked.

19:03.414 --> 19:04.574
Oh.

19:04.749 --> 19:05.841
Got a plane to catch.

19:09.086 --> 19:11.020
Oh, come on, Rose.

19:11.189 --> 19:13.350
Stop it.

19:15.693 --> 19:19.094
All right, fine. Take your little cab ride.

19:19.263 --> 19:21.094
See you tomorrow.

19:45.356 --> 19:46.846
Okay.

19:47.959 --> 19:49.654
Maybe not tomorrow.

20:02.940 --> 20:04.635
Oh, damn.

20:12.383 --> 20:14.578
- Hey, Charlie.
- Oh, hi.

20:14.752 --> 20:16.185
- Where's Alan?
- In the bedroom.

20:16.354 --> 20:19.050
- I have to get up early for work.
- Right, well.

20:19.223 --> 20:20.815
- See you.
- Bye.

20:21.459 --> 20:23.324
Hey, Beverly?

20:24.729 --> 20:29.792
I'm really glad you and Alan got together.
It's nice.

20:29.967 --> 20:31.491
Thank you.

20:31.669 --> 20:36.800
I hope things work out for you
and your stalker.

20:37.341 --> 20:41.107
Her name is Rose. Like the flower.

20:41.846 --> 20:42.904
Okey-dokey.

20:43.581 --> 20:46.948
See, it's on our restraining order.

20:47.952 --> 20:49.112
Uh-huh. Good night now.

21:01.065 --> 21:04.796
- Hey, Alan?
Uh, I'm not decent.

21:07.471 --> 21:11.100
- Rose is really gone.
What?

21:12.243 --> 21:14.734
I said, Rose is gone.

21:15.079 --> 21:17.309
And I feel awful.

21:18.449 --> 21:20.144
Maybe I made a huge mistake.

21:27.825 --> 21:31.454
Well, we all make mistakes.
